                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The condition of being susceptible; vulnerability."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "278906ee-361c-4790-a094-12dd232018de",
                                                "sense_id": "c89218a3-bc52-37a3-bfb6-586473607f10",
                                                "text": "It has been reported that periparturient cows undergo a period of immunosuppression of various immunological parameters associated with a high susceptibility to uterine and mammary infections […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a081786c-e750-3b99-bbe5-5d23f35430dd",
                                        "entry_id": "02c0285d-0954-3a50-bdcb-8a11902b4ce2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "emotional sensitivity."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e98199f5-851f-43ad-b46f-afc2dd3d3316",
                                                "sense_id": "a081786c-e750-3b99-bbe5-5d23f35430dd",
                                                "text": "The eyes were large and black, and had the moonlight's melancholy, with that tearful lustre which is the certain sign of keen susceptibility."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0de8e15f-9c94-36a5-89c0-b80e110d7495",
                                        "entry_id": "02c0285d-0954-3a50-bdcb-8a11902b4ce2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Being vulnerable to a treatment (usually an antibiotic or antifungal); also, the degree of such vulnerability (i.e., weak, moderate, or strong)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cd0f84ea-2923-3fd3-9080-61e60131a94f",
                                        "entry_id": "02c0285d-0954-3a50-bdcb-8a11902b4ce2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "electric susceptibility, a measure of how easily a dielectric polarizes in response to an external electric field (compare permittivity)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
